Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.97,Title,0,0,0,0,,《神探夏洛克》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,金·莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consulting criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是乐此不疲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have loved this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间的小游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}this little game of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what people do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还继续追根究底\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't stop prying…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你五内如焚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll burn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你心如刀绞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will burn the heart out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.09,0:00:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后 再抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人就是变化无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so changeable!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a weakness with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过平心而论\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to be fair to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我仅有的缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is my only weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你再穷追不舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be allowed to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒想说服你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would try to convince you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我要说的你都知道了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everything I have to say has already crossed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我的回答你也心中有数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably my answer has crossed yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我接个电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有余生的时间呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是 你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course it is. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍 记住 如果你骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again, and know that if you're lying to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会抓到你 剥你的皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find you, and I will skin you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,死期未到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong day to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有更好的选择了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get a better offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.13,0:02:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会再见面 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be hearing from me, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真有你所说的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you have what you say you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让你发财\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make you rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就用你做人皮皮鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you into shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人让他改变了主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone changed his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.85,0:03:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是不是调皮了 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, have you been wicked, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 阿德勒小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Miss Adler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:23.12,Title,0,0,0,0,,《贝尔戈维亚丑闻》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在写什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you typing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博客 - 关于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blog. - About?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你打的内容很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're typing a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看又有什么新案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我老婆经常工作到很晚 - 无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My wife seems to be spending a very long time at the office. - Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我丈夫可能有外遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think my husband might be having an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是我姑姑 她被人调包了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not my real aunt, she's been replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定这不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.43,0:04:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我分辨得出人的骨灰 - 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know human ash. - Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论您提出何种报酬 我们都能满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are prepared to offer any sum of money you care to mention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只求能找回这些文件 - 无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- for the recovery of these files. - Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们建了个网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have this website,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.58,0:05:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来解释漫画书的真正意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}it explains the true meaning of comic books,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为人们忽略了其中很多主题\N{\fnArial\fs30}cos people miss a lot of the themes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但随后所有的漫画开始变成现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then all the comic books started coming true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,极客漫画通 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geek Interpreter, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是标题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,标题有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it need a title for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有人读你的博客吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do people actually read your blog?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你以为那些委托人是怎么找来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think our clients come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己有网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a website.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在上面列举了240种不同的烟灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which you enumerate 240 different types of tobacco ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人看你的网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's reading your website.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 漂染金发 没有明显死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then, dyed blonde hair, no obvious cause of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这些不知是什么的斑点\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for these speckles, whatever they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 斑点金发女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The Speckled Blonde?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:53.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斑点金发女 三十来岁 漂染金发 身上覆满奇怪红斑）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷去世时他们不让我们去看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wouldn't let us see Granddad when he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他去了天堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that cos he'd gone to heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,人死了不会去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't really go to heaven when they die,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被送到特定地点烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're taken to a special room and burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天杜塞尔多夫（德国城市）发生一起空难\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a plane crash in Dusseldorf yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,全员遇难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,疑似遭恐怖分子炸毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspected terrorist bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也看新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do watch the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说着无聊就换台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said "Boring" and turned over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,从航班记录来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, according to the flight details,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人已办理登机手续\N{\fnArial\fs30}this man was checked in on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的大衣里有登机牌的存根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside his coat he's got a stub from his boarding pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,航班上的餐巾纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}napkins from the flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有航班特供饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}even one of those special biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的护照 在柏林机场盖过戳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's his passport, stamped at Berlin Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这人本该昨天死于德国的空难\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this man should have died in a plane crash in Germany yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却死在萨瑟克区的汽车后备箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but instead he's in a car boot in Southwark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是祸躲不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有想法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前有八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, four ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe two ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要提未解决的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, don't mention the unsolved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们想看到你凡人的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}People want to know you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they're interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪 他们为什么感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're not. Why are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1895 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 1, 895. - Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚重置了访客计数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reset that counter last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去八小时里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This blog has had nearly 2, 000 hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有将近2000人点击博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the last eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的生计来源 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your living, Sherlock,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是什么240种烟灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}not 240 different types of tobacco ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是243种\N{\fnArial\fs30}243.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次用什么标题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚脐谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belly Button Murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚脐疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Navel Treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有很多记者 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of press outside, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不是冲着我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they won't be interested in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.21,0:07:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在你走红网络前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was before you were an internet phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一些人特别要求拍你们的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of them specifically wanted photographs of you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,遮住脸 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover your face and walk fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.13,0:07:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有助于营造良好公众形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, it's good for the public image,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟是这样的大案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}big case like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是私家侦探 公众形象毫无益处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a private detective, the last thing I need is a public image.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（帽子侠和罗宾：网络侦探二人组）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:53.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（夏洛克和网络技术）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:55.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（夏洛克和约翰 博客控侦探）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:58.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（夏洛克·福尔摩斯 网络奇人）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是时候了 你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thumbs!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door was…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door was…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子们 有新客户了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys! You've got another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头说 别让我觉得无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us from the start, don't be boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:23.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（14小时前）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 您的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, phone call for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听说过夏洛克·福尔摩斯吗 - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you heard of Sherlock Holmes? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就会见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're about to meet him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的案子 你说了算 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your case, it's entirely up to you, this is just…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你提个友好建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}friendly advice, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让夏洛克在犯罪现场调查五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}give Sherlock five minutes on your crime scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么说你都听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and listen to everything that he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有尽量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as far as possible…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要揍他\N{\fnArial\fs30}try not to punch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.99,0:10:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这位先生说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this gentleman says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要跟您谈谈 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- he needs to speak to you… - Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.43,0:10:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:10:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·华生 这里能无线上网吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Watson. Are you set up for Wi-Fi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.77,0:11:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道这有点丢人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realise this is a tiny bit humiliating?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.61,0:11:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}show me to the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说丢你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't really mean for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这是六分的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is a six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,低于七分的案子不值得我离开公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no point in my leaving the flat for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经达成共识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}less than a seven, we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在往后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看草地\N{\fnArial\fs30}show me the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候达成的共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did we agree that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed it yesterday. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 近点 - 我昨天根本不在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Closer. - I wasn't even at home yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了都柏林\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in Dublin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听见是你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hardly my fault you weren't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 我不在家你还一个人叨叨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up! - Do you just carry on talking when I'm away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道你什么时候不在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, how often are you away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看排气管回火那车\N{\fnArial\fs30}show me the car that backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这辆车发出巨响的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one that made the noise, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在考虑枪击…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're thinking gunshot…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有枪击\N{\fnArial\fs30}There wasn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有中弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,致命伤是\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was killed by a single.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑后一处钝器重击\N{\fnArial\fs30}blow to the back of the head from a blunt instrument,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但凶器和凶手一起神秘消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which then magically disappeared, along with the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.29,0:12:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看这案子至少八分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be an eight, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got two more minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想知道更多司机的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}they want to know more about the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用管他 他是个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, forget him, he's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不怎么会以为自己是疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why else would he think himself a suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我认为他有嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把电脑递过去 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pass me over. - All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但电脑有静音键 我很乐意使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's a mute button, and I will use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,举高点 我才不要在下面说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up a bit! I'm not talking from down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你举着 举着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Just take it, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功谋杀且没有证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having successfully committed a crime without a single witness…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他何必又报警又找侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would he call the police and consult a detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想跟你公平竞赛 - 他在耍小聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fair play? - He's trying to be clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是过于自负了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's overconfidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,过度肥胖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morbidly obese,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,口臭熏天证明是独居单身汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}the undisguised halitosis of a single man living on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,右袖子表明他沉迷于色情网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The right sleeve of an internet porn addict,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸模式表明他是未治疗的心脏病患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}the breathing pattern of an untreated heart condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,自尊低 智商低 命不长久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Low self-esteem, tiny IQ and a limited life expectancy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.01,0:12:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然认为他能策划罪案\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you think he's a criminal mastermind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 这推论傻疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, this is just stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 我心脏怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say? Heart what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,去河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,河里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in the stream?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过去看看 - 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go and see. - Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不应门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't answering your doorbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的卧室在后面 去拿些衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}His room's through the back, get him some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 福尔摩斯先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Mr Holmes…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:12:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 怎么了 - 您得跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock, what's going on? What's happening? - You're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号断了 不知怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost him. I don't know what…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 华生医生 - 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr Watson? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找您的 - 好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's for you. - OK, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生 是直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 您要去的那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Mr Holmes, where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.67,0:13:24.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西装： 700镑）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:26.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无武器）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:28.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（修剪 整齐）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:30.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（坐办公室）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:31.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（惯用右手）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（室内工作）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:36.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:37.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（两只小狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.89,0:13:39.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（三只小狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,您一定会希望着装得体\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll want to be dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚我要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.39,0:14:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿了裤子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wearing any pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.43,0:14:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在白金汉宫哎 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Buckingham Palace. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力克制偷烟灰缸的冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah, aah, I am seriously fighting an impulse to steal an ashtray.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.37,0:15:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 正经回答我 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock, seriously, what? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来谒见女王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here to see the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, apparently, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.03,0:15:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你们一回 别这么幼稚好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just once, can you two behave like grown-ups?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们破案 我用博客记录 他忘了穿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We solve crimes, I blog about it, and he forgets his pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此不抱太大希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't hold out too much hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦考夫 我手头还有案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the middle of a case, mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么案子 驴友和发动机回火事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, the hiker and the backfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.19,0:15:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过了一眼警方报告 有点平淡无奇了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I glanced at the police report, a bit obvious, surely?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 显而易见 - 那就别操心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Transparent. - Time to move on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是白金汉宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in Buckingham Palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个英国的中枢之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very heart of the British nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克·福尔摩斯 穿上裤子 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock Holmes, put your trousers on! - What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your client.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的客户是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my client is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,地位显赫 尊荣至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Illustrious, in the extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我必须说明 客户身份绝对保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remaining, I have to inform you, entirely anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦考夫 - 哈瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mycroft. - Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,舍弟礼数不周 请允许我代他道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I just apologise for the state of my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是他太忙了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A full-time occupation, I imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位一定是约翰·华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this must be Dr John Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.72,0:16:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾在诺森伯兰第五燧发枪手团服役\N{\fnArial\fs30}formerly of the Fifth Northumberland Fusiliers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.23,0:16:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我老板非常喜欢你的博客 - 你老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My employer is a tremendous fan of your blog. - Your employer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其喜欢写铝拐杖的那一篇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly enjoyed the one about the aluminium crutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位年轻的福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mr Holmes the Younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有照片上那么高\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look taller in your photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏那件修身外套和这位矮个子朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take the precaution of a good coat and a short friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦考夫 我不接匿名客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, I don't do anonymous clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我习惯了案子一头是谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm used to mystery at one end of my cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,两头都是谜就太麻烦了 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}both ends is too much work. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,此案事关国家 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a matter of national importance. Grow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 松开我的床单 - 不然呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off my sheet! - Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就直接走出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我成全你 - 两位 注意场合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll let you. - Boys, please…not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位客户到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is my client?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你在什么地方 然后动脑筋想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at where you're standing, and make a deduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,雇你的是全国最有权势的人 还要点明吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to be engaged by the highest in the land, now, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.49,0:16:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把衣服穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your clothes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小到大就是听你招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is a whole childhood in a nutshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老板遇到了棘手的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}My employer has a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现了一件极其敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}A matter has come to light of an extremely delicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,且可以有犯罪性质的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and potentially criminal nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此紧急关头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in this hour of need,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的弟弟 有人想到了你 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- dear brother, your name has arisen. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有各种各样的警力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a police force of sorts,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有无孔不入的军情六处\N{\fnArial\fs30}even a marginally secret service.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么来找我 - 大家都找你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why come to me? - People come to you for help,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't they, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但名下有海军的人可没找过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to date anyone with a navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,此案关系到最高机密 以及信任问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a matter of the highest security, and therefore of trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.86,0:17:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 连自家的情报机关也信不过 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't trust your own secret service? - Naturally not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都为了钱监视别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all spy on people for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do think we have a timetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course. Erm…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这个女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.37,0:17:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就要多加注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you should be paying more attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去年成为两起政党丑闻的焦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been at the centre of two political scandals in the last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近又与某著名作家离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and recently ended the marriage of a prominent novelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她不仅给老公带绿帽子 还脚踏两条船\N{\fnArial\fs30}by having an affair with both participants separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我对花边新闻不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I don't concern myself with trivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.77,0:18:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳·阿德勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irene Adler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,业内称她为「那个女人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professionally known as "The Woman".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,业内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professionally?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有很多外号 她最喜欢「施虐女王」\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many names for what she does. She prefers "Dominatrix".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:30.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（读取图片）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 施虐女王 - 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dominatrix. - Don't be alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是性方面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's to do with sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,性不会让我紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sex doesn't alarm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她提供的是 这样说吧 愉悦的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}She provides, shall we say, recreational scolding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,给那些有此嗜好\N{\fnArial\fs30}for those who enjoy that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,且乐意付钱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and are prepared to pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是从她的网站下载的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are all from her website.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这位阿德勒女士有一些不能见光的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assume this Adler woman has some compromising photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你反应很快 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very quick, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不难推断 到底是谁的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly a difficult deduction. Photographs of whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个对我老板很重要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A person of significance to my employer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我们不要再谈这方面的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd prefer not to say any more at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么都不说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't tell us anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你们 是个年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you it's a young person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.61,0:19:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位年轻女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young female person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片有多少张\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many photographs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 数量不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}A considerable number, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿德勒小姐和这位年轻女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do Miss Adler and this young female.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 同时出现在照片里 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- person appear in these photographs together? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜照片上有许多不能见光的场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume in a number of compromising scenarios?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我们的想象 这是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An imaginative range, we are assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你现在最好把茶杯放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, you might want to put that cup back in your saucer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能帮忙吗 福尔摩斯先生 - 怎么帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you help us, Mr Holmes? - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意接这个案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you take the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.17,0:20:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What case?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻给钱 要多少给多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay her, now and in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像阿德勒小姐题头说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Miss Adler remarks in her masthead,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,人要知道认栽\N{\fnArial\fs30}know when you are beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.55,0:20:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她什么都不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't want anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她联系过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她通知我们说她有那些照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}She informed us that the photographs existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,明确表示没打算使用这些照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}She indicated that she had no intention to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,敲诈钱财或是别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to extort either money or favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,炫耀力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a power play.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,向大英最有权势的家族炫耀力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}A power play with the most powerful family in Britain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愧是施虐女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that is a dominatrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就很有趣了嘛 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, this is getting rather fun, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 - 她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock… - Hmm. Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她目前在伦敦 她在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In London, currently. She's staying…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,细节发短信给我 晚上再跟你们联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Text me the details, I'll be in touch by the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定到时候能搞到消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think you'll have news by then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我到时候能搞到照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think I'll have the photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿你真像说的那么神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}One can only hope you're as good as you seem to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:43.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:45.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（骑马 公学 早起 睡左边）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:47.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（嗜茶 父亲 书迷 不抽烟 一半威尔士血统）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我还需要些器具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need some equipment, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要什么都行 我会派人送到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you require, I'll have it sent…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.30,0:20:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能给我一盒火柴吗 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I have a box of matches? - I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是打火机 都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or your cigarette lighter, either will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不抽烟 - 这我知道 但你老板抽烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't smoke. - No, I know you don't, but your employer does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件小事我们一直对外隐瞒着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have kept a lot of people successfully in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人都不知道 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}about this little fact, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是大多数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the Commonwealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这样算是谦虚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's as modest as he gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你怎么知道抽烟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, the smoking, how did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据就在你眼皮底下 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evidence was right under your nose, John,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了 却没有注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}as ever you see, but do not observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.72,0:21:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意到什么 - 烟灰缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Observe what? - The ashtray.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.69,0:21:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有客人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to have a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要花点时间准备一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need a bit of time to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要很久吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm…ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.27,0:22:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.27,0:22:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要上战场了 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to into battle, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.27,0:22:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,得换一身好盔甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the right armour.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.65,0:22:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.83,0:22:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.02,0:22:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什么都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything works on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.63,0:22:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道她的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know her address.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接按她家门铃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just ring her doorbell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就在这儿停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. Just here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.47,0:22:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就没换衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't even change your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.89,0:22:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以该添点儿颜色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it's time to add a splash of colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.50,0:22:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两条街 但就在这儿做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two streets away, but this will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.95,0:22:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做什么 - 朝我的脸来一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For what? - Punch me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shade?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,血红\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打你 - 没错 打我的脸 没听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Punch you? - Yes, punch me, in the face. Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话的时候我总觉得你是在找揍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always hear "Punch me in the face" when you're speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.87,0:22:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没这么明说\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's usually sub-text.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.09,0:22:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是婆婆妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.07,0:23:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 这真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, that was…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我们打完了 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I think we're done now, John!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.77,0:23:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记清楚 夏洛克 我当过兵 杀过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to remember, Sherlock, I was a soldier. I killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是军医 - 我也有心情不好的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were a doctor! - I had bad days!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算穿什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.38,0:23:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 招牌战衣 - 幸运的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My battle dress. - Oh, lucky boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.82,0:23:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打搅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, very sorry to disturb you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.25,0:23:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才有人打了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}um, I've just been attacked, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像拿走了我的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}um, and I think they, they took my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.99,0:23:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, um, and my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, please could you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.17,0:23:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要的话 我可以帮你报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can phone the police, if you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.22,0:23:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 请帮我报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Could you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这儿等他们来 你不介意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind if I just waited here, just until they come?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.65,0:23:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 万分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.64,0:23:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.84,0:24:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it all happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有急救箱吗 - 在厨房里 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you got a first aid kit? - In the kitchen. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.41,0:24:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.87,0:24:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可怜 听说你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sorry to hear you've been hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.22,0:24:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯特还没问过你的名字吧 - 抱歉 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think Kate caught your name? - I'm so sorry, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,人在大吃一惊的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always hard to remember an alias.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.86,0:24:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难想起编好的化名 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you've had a fright. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.73,0:24:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.35,0:24:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both defrocked…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.36,0:24:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.46,0:24:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是阿德勒小姐吧 - 瞧瞧这对颧骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss Adler, I presume. - Look at those cheekbones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.56,0:24:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是一巴掌扇过去我会割到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could cut myself slapping that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.58,0:24:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要我来试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like me to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.91,0:24:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, this should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.37,0:24:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我错过了一场好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've missed something, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.05,0:24:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐 想喝茶的话 我叫女仆送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sit down. Or if you'd like some tea, I can call the maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.59,0:24:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在宫里喝过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had some at the Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.67,0:24:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. - Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.29,0:25:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在宫里喝过茶了 如果有人要问的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a tea too, at the Palace. If anyone's interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.59,0:25:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,（两天没换的衬衫
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.76,0:25:17.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手动剃须）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:19.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（今晚有约会）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.39,0:25:22.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（没给姐姐打电话）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.17,0:25:23.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新牙刷）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.48,0:25:24.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（和史丹佛一起 夜不归宿）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.54,0:25:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道伪装的最大问题吗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know the big problem with a disguise, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.99,0:25:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你多么努力 总是一幅自画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}However hard you try, it's always a self-portrait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.89,0:25:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我是头破血流的牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm a vicar with a bleeding face?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.46,0:25:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得你神志不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think you're damaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.81,0:25:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉溺幻想 坚持无上的权威\N{\fnArial\fs30}delusional and believe in a higher power.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.42,0:25:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的权威 便是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your case, it's yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.65,0:25:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人很爱惜你嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, and somebody loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.16,0:25:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要我打你的脸 我也会避开鼻子和牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had to punch that face, I'd avoid your nose and teeth, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 你能别这样光着身子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha! Could you put something on, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.09,0:26:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿纸巾遮一遮吧 - 怎么 你很尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Er, anything at all. A napkin? - Why? Are you feeling exposed?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.10,0:26:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为约翰并不知道该看哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think John knows where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.82,0:26:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 他很清楚该看哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think he knows exactly where.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.09,0:26:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒是你 我不敢肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.41,0:26:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是想看女人的裸体 就借约翰的手提\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was to look at naked women, I'd borrow John's laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.56,0:26:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确实借了我的手提 - 那是没收\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do borrow my laptop. - I confiscate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.83,0:26:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 我们还有正经事要谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind, we've got better things to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.07,0:26:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me, I need to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.71,0:26:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,案子是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}how was it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.27,0:26:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.78,0:26:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑袋挨了一下的驴友 他怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hiker with the bashed-in head. How was he killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.90,0:26:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来不是为了这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.79,0:26:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 你的目标是拿走照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You're here for the photographs,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.68,0:26:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会让你拿到 所以不如我们随便聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's never going to happen and as we're chatting…anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.34,0:26:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个案子没有公开 你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That story's not out. How do you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.63,0:26:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一位警察 我知道他的癖好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know one of the policemen. Well, I know what he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.32,0:26:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you…like policemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.13,0:26:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢侦探故事 还有侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like detective stories. And detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.08,0:26:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明是性感的新定义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brainy is the new sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.01,0:26:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,车位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The position car…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.07,0:26:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,车与驴友的相对位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The position of the car relative to the hiker,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.41,0:26:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,车回火的时机 还有那致命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}the time of the backfire, that and the fact that the death blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.21,0:26:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在他的脑后 你知道这些就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was to the back of the head, that's all you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.29,0:27:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 告诉我他怎么被杀 - 不是被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, tell me, how was he murdered? - He wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.69,0:27:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得不是凶杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think it was murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道不是 - 怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know it wasn't. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.45,0:27:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我知道死者是位出色的冒险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same way that I know the victim was a excellent sportsman,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.68,0:27:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚从海外旅行归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}recently returned from foreign travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.98,0:27:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要找的照片就在这个房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that the photographs I'm looking for are in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.39,0:27:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 可怎么知道 - 这么说还真在 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, but how? - So they are in this room. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.43,0:27:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 把守房门 别让人进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, man the door, let no-one in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.94,0:27:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,乡村野外 只有两个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men alone in the countryside,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.70,0:27:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,相隔几码远 还有一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}several yards apart and one car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.46,0:27:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你要开始找照片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I… I thought you were looking for the photos now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.15,0:27:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.75,0:27:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找要花上好久 我能直接找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking takes ages, I'm just going to find them,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.10,0:27:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你还算聪明 我们又有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're moderate clever and we've got a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.61,0:27:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们消遣一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's pass the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人 一辆车 没有其他人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men, a car, nobody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.41,0:27:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机想要修好他的发动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driver's trying to fix his engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.23,0:27:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.11,0:27:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而驴友正在休息 望着天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the hiker is taking a moment, looking at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.30,0:27:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在看鸟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching the birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.23,0:27:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时都会有事要发生 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any moment now, something is going to happen. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.85,0:27:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 驴友要死了 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The hiker is going to die. - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.35,0:27:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是结果 要发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the result. What's going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.42,0:28:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不懂 - 试着去理解吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand. - Oh, well try to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 因为你迎合衰人的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Because you cater to the whims of the pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.41,0:28:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱得精光只为了让人印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take your clothes off to make an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.38,0:28:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我无聊 开动脑筋吧 这是性感的新定义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop boring me and think. It's the new sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.97,0:28:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,车要回火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car's going to backfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.87,0:28:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,会发出很大的响声\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's going to be a loud noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.94,0:28:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又如何 - 声音很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what? - Oh. Noises are important.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.94,0:28:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音会告诉你一切 比如…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noises can tell you everything. For instance…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.53,0:28:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.21,0:28:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到火警警报 母亲会向孩子的方向望去\N{\fnArial\fs30}On hearing a smoke alarm, a mother would look towards her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.77,0:28:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大火能暴露我们最在意的东西 真神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing how fire exposes our priorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.28,0:28:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真心希望这里面没有小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really hope you don't have a baby in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.94,0:28:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 约翰 你可以把警报关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, John, you can turn it off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.79,0:28:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你可以关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said you can turn it off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.19,0:28:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.26,0:28:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.97,0:29:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,按键的时候要记得戴手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should always use gloves with these things, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.15,0:29:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,最先按到的键上的油渍总是最重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaviest oil deposit is always on the first key used,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.11,0:29:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然就是3了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's quite clear the 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.09,0:29:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这之后的按键顺序几乎看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but after that, the sequence is almost impossible to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.40,0:29:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的保险箱应该是六位密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it's a six digit code.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.46,0:29:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能是你的生日 无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be your birthday, no disrespect,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.09,0:29:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你显然是个八零后 而8几乎没用到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but clearly you were born in the '80s and 8's barely used, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就能告诉你密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd tell you the code right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.53,0:29:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实呢 我已经告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you know what? I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.49,0:29:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动脑筋吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.80,0:29:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,手放在脑后 跪在地上 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands behind your head, on the floor, keep it still!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.77,0:29:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.39,0:29:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿德勒小姐 跪在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Adler, on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.17,0:29:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要我也跪在地上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want me on the floor, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.25,0:29:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生 我要你打开保险箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, I want you to open the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.34,0:29:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人 有意思 你们怎么会感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}American. Interesting. Why would you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.33,0:29:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 立刻打开保险箱 - 我不知道密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, the safe, now, please. - I don't know the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.97,0:29:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在监听 她说她告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been listening, she said she told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.90,0:29:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们真的在听 就会知道她没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you've been listening, you'll know she didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.09,0:29:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我一定漏了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assuming I missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.79,0:29:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你这么聪明的人肯定没有漏掉 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your reputation, I'm assuming you didn't, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.93,0:29:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷 她才是知道密码的人 问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, she's the one who knows the code, ask her!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.59,0:29:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 先生 不过她也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, she also knows the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.55,0:29:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,能自动报警 触响被盗警报的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}that automatically calls the police and sets off the burglar alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.53,0:29:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经学会不去信任这个女人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've learned not to trust this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯先生不… - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Holmes doesn't… - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再说一个字 一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more word out of you, just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.71,0:30:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就崩得你脑浆涂墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will decorate that wall with the insides of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.75,0:30:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我来说可不是难事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, for me, will not be a hardship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.15,0:30:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚彻先生 数到三 杀了华生医生 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Archer, at the count of three, shoot Dr Watson. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.37,0:30:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.95,0:30:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一 - 我不知道密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One. - I don't know the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.66,0:30:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二 - 她没告诉我 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two.- She didn't tell me, I don't know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.20,0:30:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随时都准备相信你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm prepared to believe you, any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.50,0:30:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 - 别 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three! - No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.89,0:30:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 福尔摩斯先生 请打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr Holmes. Open it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.05,0:30:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vatican cameos!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.07,0:31:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有劳了 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you mind? - Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.17,0:31:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.01,0:31:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.17,0:31:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你观察力十分敏锐 - 观察力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were very observant. - Observant?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.00,0:31:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我受宠若惊 - 不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm flattered. - Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.37,0:31:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 受宠若惊 - 他们还会有人赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Flattered? - There'll be more of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.01,0:31:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定有人盯着这栋楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll be keeping an eye on the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该报警 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should call the police. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.37,0:31:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就来 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On their way. - For God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.35,0:31:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 这样快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up, it's quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.75,0:31:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查房子其他房间 看看他们怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the rest of the house, see how they got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.84,0:31:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是囊中的珍宝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the knighthood in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.24,0:31:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and that's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:32:00.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手机已锁 请输入密码）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.45,0:32:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想照片都在这里了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the photographs are on here, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.38,0:32:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我当然还有副本 - 你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have copies, of course. - No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.28,0:32:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定彻底解除了任何数据传输功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have permanently disabled any kind of uplink or connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.21,0:32:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不能证明这部电话里的内容独一无二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless the contents of this phone prove to be unique,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.14,0:32:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也卖不出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't be able to sell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.22,0:32:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我要卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said I'm selling?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.87,0:32:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不他们怎么会感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why would they be interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.12,0:32:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管手机里有什么 显然不止是照片那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's on the phone, it's clearly not just photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.31,0:32:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那部摄像手机是我的身家性命 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That camera-phone is my life, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.29,0:32:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我给你除非我死了 它是我的护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd die before I let you take it. It's my protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.93,0:32:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 - 现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock! - It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.06,0:32:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定是从这边进来的 - 显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Must have come in this way. - Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.09,0:32:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 她只是昏过去了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, she's just out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.57,0:32:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天晓得她都习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God knows she's used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.74,0:32:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个后门 快去检查一下吧 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a back door. Better check it, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.86,0:32:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.52,0:32:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.41,0:33:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的陷阱刚刚杀了个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your booby trap did just kill a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.64,0:33:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他也会杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.68,0:33:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是抢先自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was self defence in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.69,0:33:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.23,0:33:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.37,0:33:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now. Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.51,0:33:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.72,0:33:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give it to me. - Argh! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.70,0:33:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for goodness sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.96,0:33:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.99,0:33:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…说…放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…said…drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.43,0:33:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, thank you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.78,0:33:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去转告那个时髦的小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell that sweet little posh thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.48,0:33:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片放在我这儿很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pictures are safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.45,0:33:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会用它们勒索她 只是为了保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not for blackmail, just for insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.49,0:33:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 我可能还想再见见她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I might want to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.31,0:33:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no no no no no no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.35,0:33:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸跟你交手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.62,0:33:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扫兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.29,0:33:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想你这样记住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how I want you to remember me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.60,0:33:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我是打败了你的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the woman who beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.27,0:34:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, Mr Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.65,0:34:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 你做了什么 - 他会睡上几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! What are you doing? - He'll sleep for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他被自己的呕吐物呛死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure he doesn't choke on his own vomit,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.05,0:34:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不尸体会很难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes for a very unattractive corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.78,0:34:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么了 你给他下了什么 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this? What have you given him? Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.75,0:34:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.21,0:34:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在很多朋友身上都用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've used it on loads of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.00,0:34:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 能听见我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.05,0:34:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 我想错了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was wrong about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.03,0:34:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确实知道该往哪看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did know where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.38,0:34:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.04,0:34:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保险箱的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key-code to my safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.38,0:34:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.98,0:34:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该告诉他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.63,0:34:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的三围\N{\fnArial\fs30}My measurements.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.26,0:34:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.24,0:34:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话 别起来 我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ssh ssh no, don't get up, I'll do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.73,0:35:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,车就要回火了 而驴友\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the car's about to backfire and the hiker,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.93,0:35:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正盯着天空看\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's staring at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.93,0:35:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他可能是在看鸟 但并非如此 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you said he could be watching birds, but he wasn't, was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.22,0:35:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在看另一种飞行物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was watching another kind of flying thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.89,0:35:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车回火 驴友回过头去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car backfires and the hiker turns to look…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.97,0:35:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这正是他犯的大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which was his big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.36,0:35:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等司机抬头看的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time the driver looks up,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.30,0:35:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴友已经死了 他没看到杀死他的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hiker is already dead. What he doesn't see is what killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.45,0:35:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那东西已经被水冲到下游了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's already being washed downstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.34,0:35:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位经验丰富的冒险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}An accomplished sportsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.24,0:35:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚从海外旅行归来 还带了个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}recently returned from foreign travel with…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.40,0:35:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞去来器回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}a boomerang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.23,0:35:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看一眼就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that from one look?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.89,0:35:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是新的性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely the new sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.88,0:35:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.33,0:35:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hush, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.31,0:35:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.91,0:36:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来还你的大衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only returning your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.27,0:36:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.46,0:36:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.26,0:36:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 我怎么回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You OK? - How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.20,0:36:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你大概记不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you remember much,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.65,0:36:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}you weren't making a lot of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.70,0:37:24.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下次再见 福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.14,0:36:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该提醒你一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I should warn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.66,0:36:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想雷斯垂德用手机把你拍下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Lestrade filmed you on his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.18,0:36:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪 - 谁在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - Where's who?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.03,0:36:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个女人 就是那个女人 - 什么女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The woman, that woman. - What woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.07,0:36:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个女人 就是那一位 - 艾琳·阿德勒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Woman! The Woman, woman! - Oh, Irene Adler?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.22,0:36:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑了 没人看见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got away, no-one saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.15,0:36:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不在这儿 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't here, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.96,0:36:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么 别别别 回到床上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you? What? No, no, no. No. Back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.94,0:36:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早上就会没事了 睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine in the morning. Just sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会没事 我就是没事 绝对没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'll be fine, I am fine. I'm absolutely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.74,0:36:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你好得不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.55,0:36:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我的话 我就在隔壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'll be next door if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.13,0:36:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我为什么会需要你 - 不为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would I need you? - No reason at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.62,0:37:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The photographs are perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.67,0:37:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个在逃的性工作者手上叫安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the hands of a fugitive sex worker?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.79,0:37:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她并不想勒索谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not interested in blackmail.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.55,0:37:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只想…得到保护 不知是为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants…protection, for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.29,0:37:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应该退出警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you've stood down the police investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.71,0:37:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对她家枪击案的调查了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the shooting at her house?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.30,0:37:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她手里有照片我们又能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we do anything while she has the photographs?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.88,0:37:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our hands are tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.72,0:37:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定喜欢你的措辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd applaud your choice of words.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.72,0:37:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看出这是怎么回事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see how this works?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.75,0:38:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那部摄像手机是她的免牢金牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That camera-phone is her get out of jail free card.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.46,0:38:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得放过她 像对待皇室那样对她 麦考夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to leave her alone. Treat her like royalty, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.71,0:38:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别像她对待皇室那样对她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though not the way she treats royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.84,0:38:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.17,0:38:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Text.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.49,0:38:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可那声音是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.57,0:38:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道还有其他人在盯着她吗 麦考夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know there were other people after her too, Mycroft,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.10,0:38:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派我和约翰去之前就知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you sent John and I in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.52,0:38:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是中情局的职业杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}CIA trained killers, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.12,0:38:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们真不赖 - 是啊 多谢了 麦考夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excellent gangs. - Yeah, thanks for that, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.98,0:38:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a disgrace,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.28,0:38:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你弟弟派去那种龙潭虎穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}sending your little brother into danger like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.00,0:38:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终究只有家人能依靠 麦考夫·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family is all we have in the end, Mycroft Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.13,0:38:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴吧 赫德森太太 - 麦考夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shut up, Mrs Hudson! - Mycroft!!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.90,0:38:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.39,0:38:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不过你确实该闭嘴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Though do in fact shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.18,0:38:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这声音不太好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a bit rude, that noise, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.12,0:38:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.85,0:38:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不会做什么 至少依我看是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing she will do, as far as I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.12,0:38:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给她设置最高监控级别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can put maximum surveillance on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.55,0:38:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必 你盯着推特就能跟踪她的行程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why bother? You can follow her on Twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.69,0:38:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她的用户名是「登顶女王」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe her user name is The Whip Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.73,0:39:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Most amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.94,0:39:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.95,0:39:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手机为什么会发出那种声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does your phone make that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.64,0:39:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.23,0:39:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它刚刚发出的那种声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}That noise, the one it just made.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.13,0:39:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是短信的铃音 意味着我收到短信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a text alert, means I've got a text.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.81,0:39:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的短信一般不会叫床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your texts don't usually make that noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.63,0:39:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人拿了我的手机 显然开了个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, somebody got hold of the phone and apparently as a joke,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.73,0:39:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把短信铃音个性化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}personalised their text alert noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.39,0:39:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说你每次收到短信就会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, so every time they text you…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.02,0:39:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would seem so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.02,0:39:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把手机声音关掉吗 要是我那个年代…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you turn that phone down a bit? At my time of life it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.49,0:39:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想谁会拿到你的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}See I'm wondering who could have got hold of your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.25,0:39:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机是在你的大衣里 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would've been in your coat, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.30,0:39:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不打扰你推理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you to your deductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.98,0:39:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 我可不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stupid, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.34,0:39:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么得出的这个结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you get that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:39:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,施行邦德航空计划 已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond Air is go, that's decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.96,0:39:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟考文垂那边核实一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check with the Coventry lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.39,0:39:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.13,0:40:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else does she have?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.65,0:40:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳·阿德勒 美国人不会为了几张敏感照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irene Adler. The Americans wouldn't be interested in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.16,0:40:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对她感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a couple of compromising photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.28,0:40:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.42,0:40:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.79,0:40:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有大事要发生了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something big's coming, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.12,0:40:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳·阿德勒已经与你无关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irene Adler is no longer any concern of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.83,0:40:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起 你不要再插手此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, you will stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.57,0:40:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是的 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, will I? - Yes, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.04,0:40:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.11,0:40:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的话 恕我失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you'll excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.19,0:40:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去向我多年的老朋友负荆请罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a long and arduous apology to make to a very old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.00,0:40:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得代我向她问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do give her my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.55,0:41:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉得太好了 夏洛克 太动听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely, Sherlock. That was lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.92,0:41:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 余音绕梁啊 - 对 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm, marvellous. - Yes, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.62,0:41:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是戴上圣诞鹿角就更完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you could have worn the antlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.79,0:41:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫德森太太 有些事总要留点想象才完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things are best left to the imagination, Mrs Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.14,0:41:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.54,0:41:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢了 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thank you, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.63,0:41:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理他 他老记错人名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, no, no, he's not good with names.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.73,0:41:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我能记起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.88,0:41:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉是那个医生 之后换了一脸痘痘的妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah was the doctor, then there was the one with the spots,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.42,0:41:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,再之后是特别傲气的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the one with the nose and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.42,0:41:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个闷蛋老师之后是谁来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was after the boring teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.17,0:41:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没了 - 你是珍妮特 稍微排除下就出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody. - Jeanette! Ah, process of elimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.01,0:41:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.55,0:41:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 抱歉来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, everyone. Sorry, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.71,0:41:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,门上写着说直接上来就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It said on the door to just come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.87,0:41:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 茉莉 你好 - 茉莉 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Molly. - Hello, Molly!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.18,0:41:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家相互打招呼 好一个礼仪之邦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody saying hello to each other, how wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.82,0:41:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮你…我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me, er… Holy Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.87,0:41:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们现在要喝圣诞特饮了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're having Christmas drinkies then?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.32,0:41:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 你要喝 没人拦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stopping them, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.43,0:41:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年里头只有今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the one day of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.35,0:41:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些小鬼会好好地陪陪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the boys have to be nice to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.98,0:41:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以也算值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it's almost worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.75,0:42:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.52,0:42:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的博客还是只有1895次点击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The counter on your blog still says 1895.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.05,0:42:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会 让人圣诞节都没心思过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, Christmas is cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.86,0:42:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然放了我戴帽子的那张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've got a photograph of me wearing that hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.50,0:42:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家都爱这张 - 才怪 说谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- People like it. - No, they don't. What people?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.65,0:42:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 髋关节怎样了 - 糟透了 谢谢关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's the hip? - Oh, it's atrocious, but thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.06,0:42:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过更糟的 不过毕竟那都是尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen much worse, but then I do post-mortems.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.56,0:42:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧我说的 抱歉 - 别说笑话 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God, sorry. - Don't make jokes, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.34,0:42:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道 抱歉 - 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, sorry. - Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.85,0:42:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 没想到你也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I wasn't expecting to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.08,0:42:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会在多塞特郡过圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were in Dorset for Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.09,0:42:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天一大早\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first thing in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.20,0:42:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能和太太重归于好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and the wife, back together, sorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.53,0:42:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎说 她跟一位体育老师上床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's sleeping with a PE teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.29,0:42:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 我听说你要去你姐姐家吧 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And John, I hear you're off to your sister's? Is that right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.51,0:42:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克抱怨过 错 是说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock was complaining. Saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.36,0:42:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有史以来她头一回洗心革面 决定戒酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time ever, she's cleaned up her act, off the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.05,0:42:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才怪 - 闭嘴 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nope. - Shut up, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.66,0:42:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你找了个新男友 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've got a new boyfriend, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.73,0:42:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对他很认真啊 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're serious about him. - Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.63,0:42:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备今晚见他 送他礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're seeing him tonight, giving him a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.64,0:42:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,消停一天行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.47,0:42:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住口 喝你的酒 - 你们别扫兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. Have a drink. - Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.81,0:42:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定也看到袋子最上面那份礼物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you all see the present on the top of the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.86,0:42:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,包装精美 还系着蝴蝶结 其余的包装马虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfectly wrapped with a bow. All the others are slapdash at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.59,0:43:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是给特别的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for someone special.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.01,0:43:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色包装纸和口红颜色一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shade of red echoes her lipstick,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.36,0:43:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是无意挑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}either an unconscious association,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.68,0:43:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是有意用它暗示对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}or one she's deliberately trying to encourage.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 霍普小姐坠入爱河了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, Miss Hooper has love on her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.74,0:43:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然她非常在乎他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she's serious about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.85,0:43:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她送给他的礼物可见一斑\N{\fnArial\fs30}is clear from the fact she's giving him a gift at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.89,0:43:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然这表明她对这段关系渴望已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That suggests long-time hopes asolutely for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.46,0:43:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她的妆容和打扮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she's seeing him tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.18,0:43:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可见她今晚一定会去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}is evident from her make-up and what she is wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.80,0:43:22.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（致最亲爱的夏洛克 茉莉敬上）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.46,0:43:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是想弥补自己嘴唇和胸部的不丰满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously trying to compensate for the size of her mouth and breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.46,0:43:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是这样出口伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always say such horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.47,0:43:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都是 一而再 再而三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time. Always. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.65,0:43:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.16,0:43:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 茉莉·霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, Molly Hooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.62,0:43:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会 那不是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! That wasn't, I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.75,0:43:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是你 是我 - 我的天啊 真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it was me. - My God, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.92,0:43:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 是我的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - My phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.42,0:44:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第57条 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fifty seven? - Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.67,0:44:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 那人已经发了57条短信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty seven of those texts, the ones I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.77,0:44:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你一直在数啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrilling that you've been counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.22,0:44:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.80,0:44:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.01,0:44:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了 失陪一下 - 你就不回复一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said excuse me. - Do you ever reply?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.10,0:44:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 千年一遇呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.48,0:44:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,该不会是打来祝我圣诞快乐的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not going to have Christmas phone calls now, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.55,0:44:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们国家颁布新政策了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have they passed a new law?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们今晚会找到艾琳·阿德勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're going to find Irene Adler tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.77,0:45:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早就掌握她的行踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.11,0:45:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你之前说的那样 找到她也不能怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were kind enough to point out, it hardly matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.45,0:45:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 你会找到她的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean you're going to find her dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.05,0:45:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You OK? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.00,0:45:22.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣巴塞洛缪医院）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.19,0:45:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这具尸体符合描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only one who fitted the description.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.24,0:45:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是把她转来这边 你的第二个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had her brought here, your home from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.54,0:45:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉 你没必要也过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't need to come in, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.79,0:45:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 大家都忙着过…圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, everyone else is busy with… Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.69,0:45:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有点毁容了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The face is a bit sort of bashed-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.53,0:45:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有点难以辨认\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it might be a bit difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.77,0:45:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是她本人吧 - 给我看看身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's her, isn't it? - Show me the rest of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.41,0:45:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.38,0:45:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 霍普小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss Hooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.35,0:46:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.75,0:46:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克怎么光凭身体就认出了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did Sherlock recognise her from… not her face?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.94,0:46:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只此一根 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just the one. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.37,0:46:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.49,0:46:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,室内抽烟 不是违反了某条…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoking indoors, isn't there one of those…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.11,0:46:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,某条法律吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of those law things?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.68,0:46:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.36,0:46:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽烟也害不了几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only so much damage you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.80,0:46:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know she was dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had an item in her possession,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.81,0:46:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说那是她的身家性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}one she said her life depended on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.46,0:46:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今却拱手相让\N{\fnArial\fs30}She chose to give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.40,0:46:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样东西在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is this item now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.31,0:47:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.43,0:47:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,投入这么深的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all care so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.49,0:47:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过咱俩也许有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever wonder if there's something wrong with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.51,0:47:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命都会终结 徒留一颗破碎的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}All lives end, all hearts are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.57,0:47:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱毫无用处 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caring is not an advantage, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.65,0:47:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是低焦油香烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is low tar.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.78,0:47:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不怎么了解她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you barely knew her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.67,0:47:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦考夫 圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.11,0:47:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,预祝新年快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a happy new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.03,0:47:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了 你有没有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on his way. Have you found anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.02,0:47:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 他有抽烟吗 - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Did he take the cigarette? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.91,0:47:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.22,0:48:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还有十分钟就到 - 卧室里没有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's coming, ten minutes. - There's nothing in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.60,0:48:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他没藏烟 有可疑的地方我们都翻过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like he's clean, we've tried all the usual places.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.34,0:48:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定今晚会有危险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure tonight's a danger night?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.29,0:48:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定 不过我向来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but then I never am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.90,0:48:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你一定要陪着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stay with him, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.91,0:48:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚有别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.62,0:48:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,推了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.95,0:48:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦考夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.78,0:48:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.96,0:48:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那些朋友完全看错你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my friends are so wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.52,0:48:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个很棒的男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a great boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.11,0:48:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.81,0:48:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向觉得自己不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought I was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.19,0:48:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说夏洛克·福尔摩斯太幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes is a very lucky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.09,0:48:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jeanette, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.15,0:48:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说真的 太感人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean it. It's heart-warming.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.27,0:48:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意为他做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll do anything for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.67,0:48:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他甚至搞混你的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he can't even tell your girlfriends apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.78,0:48:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也愿意为你做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do anything for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.15,0:48:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管开口 我一定做到 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}just tell me what it is I'm not doing. Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.35,0:48:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和夏洛克·福尔摩斯抢男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me compete with Sherlock Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.26,0:48:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你遛狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll walk your dog for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.66,0:48:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说到做到 我会帮你遛狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, I've said it, I'll even walk your dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.23,0:48:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我根本没养狗 - 哦对 那是前任女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have a dog! - No, because that was the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.54,0:49:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.73,0:49:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再联系 - 免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll call you. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.55,0:49:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.71,0:49:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你俩真的没戏了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That really wasn't very good, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.46,0:49:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来了呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.75,0:49:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.11,0:49:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你这回没翻乱我的袜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you didn't mess up my sock index this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.32,0:50:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲子很美 夏洛克 以前没听你拉过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely tune, Sherlock, haven't heard that one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.68,0:50:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在作曲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Composing?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.45,0:50:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有助于思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helps me to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.23,0:50:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.36,0:50:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你博客上的点击还是只有1895次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count on your blog is still stuck at 1895.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.39,0:50:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 出故障了 似乎修不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Faulty, can't seem to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.92,0:50:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是出故障 还是说博客被黑了 这个数字别有用意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faulty, or you've been hacked and it's a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.03,0:50:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是出故障了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just faulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.25,0:50:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.39,0:50:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.38,0:50:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm going out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.99,0:51:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 他有没有过什么女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, has he ever had any kind of girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.89,0:50:34.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手机已锁 密码：1895）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.39,0:50:36.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密码错误 还有三次机会）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.17,0:51:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,男朋友或走得近的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}boyfriend, a relationship, ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.38,0:51:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.96,0:51:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么会不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.50,0:51:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是夏洛克啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.80,0:51:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道他那聪明古怪的脑袋怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will we ever know what goes on in that funny old head?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.04,0:51:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的也是 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.15,0:51:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 在 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John? - Yeah? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.50,0:51:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 今晚打算怎么过新年\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - So, any plans for new year tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.12,0:51:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 没什么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, er… nothing fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.44,0:51:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么非做不可的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I couldn't heartlessly abandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.55,0:51:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有什么提议 - 有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have any ideas? - One.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.53,0:52:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦考夫完全可以打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mycroft could just phone me,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.70,0:52:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不能别每次都搞得这么神经兮兮\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he didn't have this bloody stupid power complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.66,0:52:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不能找间咖啡厅聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't we just go to a cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.51,0:52:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克也不是一直跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock doesn't follow me everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.53,0:52:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请往那边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.40,0:52:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.83,0:52:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了 他以为是麦考夫找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, he thinks it's Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.59,0:52:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在谱一首苦情曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's writing sad music.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.00,0:53:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吃东西 几乎不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't eat, barely talks,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.91,0:53:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔给电视节目纠下错\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to correct the television.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.47,0:53:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我看 他是真伤心了 但他可是夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say he was heart-broken, but, er, well he's Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.85,0:53:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没伤心也是这副熊样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does all that anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.73,0:53:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.16,0:53:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.99,0:53:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他不会放过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.69,0:53:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不告诉他 我也不会放过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come after you if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.39,0:53:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,无庸置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.40,0:53:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的尸体在停尸台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were dead on a slab.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.04,0:53:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绝对是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was definitely you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.30,0:53:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,DNA测试结果跟你们手上的资料一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}DNA tests are only as good as the records you keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.89,0:53:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你肯定认识管资料的人 - 我知道他的癖好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I bet you know the record keeper. - I know what he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.64,0:53:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我则需要人间蒸发\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I needed to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.60,0:53:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么还来找我 而我还不想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how come I can see you and I don't even want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.61,0:53:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我犯了个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I made a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.84,0:54:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我寄了样东西给夏洛克保管 现在我得要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent something to Sherlock for safekeeping, now I need it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.94,0:54:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以想请你帮忙 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So I need your help. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.04,0:54:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了他的安全着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for his own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.28,0:54:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做也是 跟他说你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is this. Tell him you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.83,0:54:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做不到 - 行 那我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't. - Fine, I'll tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.51,0:54:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我不会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I still won't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.34,0:54:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.52,0:54:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你平常都说什么了 你给他发了许多短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you normally say?! You've texted him a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.21,0:54:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊聊罢了 没什么不寻常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the usual stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.38,0:54:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事十分不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no usual in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.57,0:54:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 我喜欢你那顶滑稽的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Good morning. I like your funny hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.69,0:54:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚不高兴 一起吃晚饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm sad tonight, let's have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.69,0:54:33.63,Title,0,0,0,0,,你在《绳之于法》（英国广播公司一档电视节目）里真性感 一起吃晚饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hmm, you look sexy on Crimewatch, let's have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.07,0:54:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.52,0:54:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起吃晚饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let's have dinner".
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.99,0:54:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟夏洛克·福尔摩斯调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flirted with Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.41,0:54:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,单方面 他从没回过\N{\fnArial\fs30}At him. He never replies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.27,0:54:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 夏洛克每条短信都回\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sherlock always replies to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.69,0:54:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,人称「妙语连珠大师」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Mr Punchline.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.01,0:54:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是憋着一口气不死都要说赢对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will outlive God trying to have the last word.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.10,0:54:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说我对他很特别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that make me special?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.48,0:54:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 也许是的 - 你吃醋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know, maybe. - Are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.46,0:55:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们又不是一对 - 你们就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not a couple. - Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.14,0:55:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发了 我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, "I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.16,0:55:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起吃饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let's have dinner".
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.78,0:55:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实又有谁真正了解夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell knows about Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.99,0:55:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免这世上仍有人在乎 我还是声明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for the record, if anyone out there still cares,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.71,0:55:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not actually gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.23,0:55:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我是 看看咱们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am. Look at us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.98,0:55:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是别追了 你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.45,0:56:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.28,0:56:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.16,0:57:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 - 赫德森太太 别哭哭啼啼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Sherlock, Sherlock… - Don't snivel, Mrs Hudson,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.79,0:57:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼泪是挡不住子弹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll do nothing to impede the flight of a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.48,0:57:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则那该是个多么柔情的世界啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a tender world that would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.52,0:57:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, Sherlock…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.37,0:57:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你手上有我们想要的东西 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that you have something that we want, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.48,0:57:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不问我要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't you ask for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.74,0:57:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问过这位了 不过她看来完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've been asking this one, she doesn't seem to know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.82,0:57:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道我要什么 对吧 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what I'm asking for, don't you, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.02,0:57:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.68,0:57:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.14,0:57:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把你的手下打发走\N{\fnArial\fs30}First get rid of your boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.31,0:57:42.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（颈动脉 颅骨 眼睛）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.65,0:57:44.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（动脉 肺部 肋骨）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.80,0:57:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 我不喜欢以一敌三\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - I dislike being outnumbered,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.71,0:57:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然这间屋子里的蠢货就太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes for too much stupid in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.67,0:58:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们两个回车里 - 然后开车走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You two, go to the car. - Then get into the car and drive away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.78,0:58:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想骗我 你知道我是谁 这可没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try to trick me, you know who I am, it doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.99,0:58:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后别再用枪指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next, you can stop pointing that gun at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.15,0:58:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让你用枪指着我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can point a gun at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.94,0:58:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.16,0:58:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能让我搜下吗 - 快来搜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mind if I check? - Oh, I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.52,0:58:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.92,0:58:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, thank you. - You're all right now, you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.12,0:59:06.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（犯罪现场 务必打扰）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.70,0:59:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.82,0:59:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧槽 这究竟是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, what the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.49,0:59:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫德森太太被个美国人打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson has been attacked by an American,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.40,0:59:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在声张正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm restoring balance to the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.20,0:59:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫德森太太 老天啊 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson, my God, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.61,0:59:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, what have they done to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.03,0:59:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm just being so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.88,0:59:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带到楼下去 照看好她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her downstairs and look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.17,0:59:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我来给你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, I'll have a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.34,0:59:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.53,0:59:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要不要告诉我是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.43,0:59:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect so, now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.34,0:59:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lestrade?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.26,0:59:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人非法闯入我们在贝克街的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had a break-in at Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.97,0:59:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你手下最不讨人厌的警官派来 再叫辆救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send your least irritating officers and an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.85,0:59:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.14,0:59:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个闯入者 他把自己弄伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's the burglar, he's got himself rather badly injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,断了几根肋骨 脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a few broken ribs, fractured skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.95,0:59:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可能伤了肺\N{\fnArial\fs30}suspected punctured lung…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.85,0:59:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从窗子摔下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fell out of a window.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.27,1:00:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it stings.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.82,1:00:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,摔在了我的垃圾桶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that was right on my bins.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.76,1:00:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底摔下来了几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And exactly how many times did he fall out the window?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.92,1:00:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记不清了 探长大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a bit of a blur, Detective Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.70,1:00:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost count.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.81,1:00:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她今晚得睡在楼上我们房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll have to sleep upstairs in our flat tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.03,1:00:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to look after her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.26,1:00:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 她没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No… - She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.11,1:00:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她有事 看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's not, look at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.21,1:00:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她得搬离贝克街几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got to take some time away from Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.31,1:00:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以去她姐姐家住 这是医嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can stay with her sister, doctor's orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.17,1:00:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别傻了 - 老天爷 她受惊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be absurd. - She's in shock, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.64,1:00:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为那天煞的摄像手机 手机到底在哪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all over some stupid camera-phone. Where is it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.59,1:00:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safest place I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.90,1:00:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把手机放在你第二好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left it in the pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.12,1:00:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡衣袍子口袋里了 你个呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your second best dressing gown, you clot!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.70,1:00:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为我被吓哭的时候 我设法拿了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to sneak it out when they thought I was having a cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.24,1:00:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.92,1:01:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真丢脸 约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame on you, John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.59,1:01:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么了 - 赫德森太太怎么能离开贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shame on me? - Mrs Hudson leave Baker Street?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.45,1:01:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然英国可要沦陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}England would fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.01,1:01:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机现在又在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it now?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.07,1:01:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会找的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where no-one will look.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.11,1:01:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那手机上有什么 肯定不只是照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's on that phone is more than just pictures.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.53,1:01:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.33,1:01:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, she's alive then.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.14,1:01:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对此是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we feeling about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.05,1:01:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,新年快乐 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy New Year, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.14,1:01:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你会再见到她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you'll be seeing her again?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.53,1:02:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是手机吗 - 是部摄像手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a phone? - It's a camera-phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.87,1:02:12.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新年快乐 —夏·福）
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.04,1:02:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在扫描手机吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you're x-raying it? - Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.97,1:02:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁的手机 - 一个女人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whose phone is it? - A woman's.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.98,1:02:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你女朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.78,1:02:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扫描她的东西就代表她是我女友了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my girlfriend because I'm x-raying her possessions?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.65,1:02:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都会做傻事 - 那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, we all do silly things! - Yes…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.28,1:02:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是这样 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.79,1:02:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very silly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.17,1:02:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把手机送到我公寓的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sent this to my address.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.98,1:02:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她就是爱玩游戏 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She loves to play games. - She does?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.08,1:02:54.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手机已锁）
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.28,1:03:01.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密码错误 还有两次机会）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.56,1:03:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sherlock…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.36,1:03:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有了个客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a client.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.97,1:03:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 在你卧室里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, in your bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.88,1:03:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 谁在追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who's after you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.22,1:04:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想要杀我的人 - 是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- People who want to kill me. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.97,1:04:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.34,1:04:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得再具体一点也无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would help if you were a tiny bit more specific.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.38,1:04:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你假造了自己的死 就是想甩开他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you faked your own death to get ahead of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.35,1:04:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.23,1:04:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但接着你告诉了约翰 也就是告诉了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except you let John know you're alive, therefore me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.70,1:04:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会替我保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd keep my secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.38,1:04:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.43,1:04:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没说出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.64,1:04:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的摄像手机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my camera-phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.17,1:04:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.71,1:04:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又不蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.11,1:04:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们拿它做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.71,1:04:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们认为手机在你手上 肯定会监视你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they've guessed you got it, they'll be watching you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.75,1:04:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是那样 他们就会知道我几个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they've been watching me, they'll know I took a safety deposit box.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.13,1:04:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在斯特兰德租了个保险储存箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a bank on the Strand a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.34,1:04:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那部手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.44,1:04:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这么过去拿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can't just go and get it, can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.02,1:04:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉·霍普 她能把手机拿到巴茨医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly Hooper, she could collect it, take it to Barts.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.33,1:04:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去找个替你跑腿的流浪汉取过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one of your homeless network could bring it here,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.16,1:04:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在咖啡厅里\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave it in the cafe,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.09,1:04:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让咖啡厅的招待把手机拿上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the boys downstairs could bring it up the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.33,1:04:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 约翰 计划得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, John, excellent plan,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.94,1:04:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,能想到的都想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of intelligent precautions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.43,1:04:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 那我这就去打电话给…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. So, why don't I phone…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.01,1:04:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面你都藏了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you keep on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.30,1:05:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说大致上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In general, I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.18,1:05:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片 情报 所有我觉得有用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pictures, information, anything I might find useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.91,1:05:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了敲诈吗 - 是为了保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For blackmail? - For protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.83,1:05:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人闯天下 难免有不得当的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make my way in the world, I misbehave.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.97,1:05:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得保证在我需要的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to know people will be on my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.74,1:05:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人能为我提供帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}exactly when I need them to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.65,1:05:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是怎么搞来这些情报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do you acquire this information?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.19,1:05:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说了 我的行为不得当\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I misbehave.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.63,1:05:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得到了比护盾更危险的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've acquired something more danger than protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.75,1:05:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道是什么吗 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know what it is? - Yes…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.57,1:05:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我搞不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.96,1:05:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也是 让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assumed. Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.16,1:05:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The passcode.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.77,1:05:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.74,1:05:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 因为这只是我做的复制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, because it's a duplicate I had made.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.29,1:05:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我知道你输入了什么密码 是1058\N{\fnArial\fs30}into which you just entered the numbers 1058.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.90,1:05:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assumed you'd choose something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.30,1:05:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,更有意义的密码 不过还是谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}more specific than that, but thanks, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.74,1:06:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说过那部手机是我的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that camera-phone was my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.84,1:06:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是真的我一摸就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know when it's in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.34,1:06:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're rather good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.94,1:06:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.11,1:06:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈米什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamish.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.87,1:06:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·哈米什·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Hamish Watson,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.39,1:06:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们在考虑给孩子起什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}just if you were looking for baby names.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.48,1:06:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个男人 国防部的官员 我知道他的癖好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a man, an MOD official and I knew what he liked.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.42,1:06:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢炫耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the things he liked was showing off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.88,1:06:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我说 这封邮件可以拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me this email was going to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.92,1:06:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道我拍了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't know it but I photographed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.02,1:06:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时有点脱不开身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a bit tied up at the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.14,1:06:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏幕上看有点小 你能看清楚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit small on that screen, can you read it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.53,1:06:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能 - 显然是密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Code, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.40,1:06:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让英国最厉害的解码专家看了看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had one of the country's best cryptographers take a look,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.76,1:06:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他当时是倒挂着\N{\fnArial\fs30}though he was mostly upside down, as I recall.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.84,1:06:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,解不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.14,1:06:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有办法吗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you do, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.45,1:06:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 露一手给姑娘看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, impress a girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.48,1:05:55.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手机已锁）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.49,1:06:00.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手机已锁 密码： 1058）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.41,1:06:03.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密码错误 还有一次机会）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.79,1:06:45.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（007确认位置）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.12,1:07:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能稍有偏差\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a margin for error,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.20,1:07:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我肯定是架波音747\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm pretty sure there's a 747.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.45,1:07:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚六点半将于西斯罗机场起飞 去往巴尔的摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving Heathrow tomorrow at 6.30 in the evenning for Baltimore.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.99,1:07:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是能拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently it's going to save the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.00,1:07:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不确定怎么个救法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure how that could be true,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.83,1:07:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但等我一会儿 我才想了八秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}but give me a moment, I've only been on the case eight seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.69,1:07:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 这不是密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, it's not code,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.60,1:07:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是客机上的座位号\N{\fnArial\fs30}these are seats capitations on a passenger jet.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.38,1:07:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 没有字母I 因为会和数字1搞混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, no "I" because it can be mistaken for one.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.08,1:07:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有K以后的字母 因为飞机就这么宽\N{\fnArial\fs30}No letters past "K", the width of the plane is the limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.54,1:07:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,数字总是完全无序地排列\N{\fnArial\fs30}The numbers always appear randomly and not in sequence,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.71,1:07:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而字母则三两个顺序地乱排\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the letters have little runs of sequence all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.93,1:07:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为家人和夫妻都坐在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Families and couples sitting together.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.71,1:07:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有巨型喷气式飞机的座椅才会排到K\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a Jumbo's wide enough to need a letter "K".
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.72,1:07:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有55排以上 因为还有二层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or rows past 55, which is why there's always an upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.21,1:07:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有13排说明不是那些迷信的航空公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a row 13, which eliminates the more superstitious airlines.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.72,1:07:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,航班号的组合规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's the style of the flight number,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.09,1:07:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 又能排除一些信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}"007", that eliminates a few more.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.96,1:07:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到最初的情报来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}And assuming a British point of origin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.29,1:07:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以合理推断航班从英国起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would be logical considering the original source of the information,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.57,1:07:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受到的压力越来越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and assuming from the increase pressure on you,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.06,1:08:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可见危机迫在眉睫\N{\fnArial\fs30}the crisis is imminent,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.56,1:08:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一符合所有条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only flight that matches all the criteria.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.00,1:08:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且在本周起飞的飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}departs within the week.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.04,1:08:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是明晚六点半从西斯罗起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the 6.30 to Baltimore tomorrow evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.76,1:08:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去巴尔的摩的那班\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Heathrow airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.93,1:08:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必表示惊叹或表达赞扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't feel obliged to tell me that was remarkable or amazing,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.02,1:08:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰已经用光了所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}John's expressed that thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.89,1:08:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,能表示赞扬的语句来夸赞我\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every possible variant available in the English language.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.39,1:08:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想在这个书桌上要了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you right here, on this desk,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.86,1:08:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要到你求饶 还是两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you begged for mercy twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.60,1:08:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 能否查下航班表 看看我说得对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, can you check those flight schedules, see if I'm right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.29,1:08:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.92,1:08:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子从没求过绕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never begged for mercy in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.32,1:08:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次要求饶 还是两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.32,1:08:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你说得没错 007号航班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right, flight double "o" seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.04,1:08:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say? - You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.67,1:08:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你之后说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what did you say after that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.42,1:08:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 007号航班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double "o" seven, flight double "o" seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.96,1:08:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double "o" seven, double "o" seven…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.23,1:08:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,007有什么含义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something, double "o" seven…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.14,1:08:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.74,1:09:06.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（波音 747 明天晚上 六点半 西斯罗 机场）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.16,1:09:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double "o" seven, double "o" seven, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.69,1:09:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, something, what?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.35,1:09:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,施行邦德航空计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond Air is go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.48,1:09:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,施行邦德航空计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond Air is go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.15,1:09:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,施行邦德航空计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond Air is go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.47,1:09:24.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喷气式飞机 向你问好 亲爱的福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.83,1:09:26.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喷气式飞机 向你问好 亲爱的福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.83,1:09:29.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喷气式飞机 向你问好 亲爱的福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.09,1:09:29.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喷气式飞机 向你问好 亲爱的福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.84,1:09:45.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喷气式飞机 向你问好 亲爱的福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.36,1:10:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,施行邦德航空计划 已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bond Air is go, that's decided.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.23,1:10:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟考文垂那边核实一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Check with the Coventry lot."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.67,1:10:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 考文垂 - 我从没去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coventry. - I've never been.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.84,1:10:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.99,1:10:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's John?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.57,1:10:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出去了 出去了几小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went out, a couple of hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.47,1:10:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是在和他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just talking to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.80,1:10:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了你会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.90,1:10:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,考文垂和这又有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Coventry got to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.69,1:10:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是个说法 不知是真是假\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a story, probably not true…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.11,1:10:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在二战期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Second World War,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.03,1:10:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,盟军知道考文垂会被德军轰炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}the allies knew Coventry was going to get bombed,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.04,1:10:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们破解了德军的密码机\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they'd broken the German code,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.58,1:11:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不想让德国知道他们破了密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}but didn't want the Germans to know that they've broken the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.02,1:11:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们就任其被轰炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they let it happen anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.27,1:11:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有和谁亲密接触过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever had anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.29,1:11:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.56,1:11:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的接触可是下流含义哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I say had, I'm being indelicate.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.00,1:11:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不懂 - 那我委婉点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand. - I'll be delicate then.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.23,1:11:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一起吃晚饭吧 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's have dinner. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.80,1:11:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.61,1:11:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不饿 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.40,1:11:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么想要吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I…want to have dinner…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.22,1:11:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wasn't hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.90,1:11:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 如果这是世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, if it was the end of the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.39,1:11:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是毁灭前的最后一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this was the very last night…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.82,1:11:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会和我一起吃晚饭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you have dinner with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.41,1:11:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.96,1:11:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.66,1:11:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是世界末日 而是赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the end of the world, that's Mrs Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.35,1:11:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 有个男人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, this man was at the door,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.77,1:11:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,门铃不会坏了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the bell still not working?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.71,1:11:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shot it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.91,1:11:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是来带走我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you come to take me away again?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.82,1:12:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 福尔摩斯先生 - 那我拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Mr Holmes. - Well, I decline.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.54,1:12:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你不会拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.28,1:12:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有架客机上有炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's going to be a bomb on a passenger jet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.68,1:12:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国人和美国人都知道这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British and American governments know about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.39,1:12:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为了不暴露他们的情报来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}but rather than expose their source of their information.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.83,1:12:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们决定任其发生 飞机会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to let it happen, the plane will blow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.84,1:12:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,考文垂事件的重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coventry all over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.14,1:12:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,时过境迁 烂事依然\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wheel turns, nothing is ever new.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.53,1:13:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're looking all better.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.18,1:13:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.20,1:13:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如想冲你脑袋来上一枪吗 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like putting a bullet in your brain, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.52,1:13:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是这么干了 他们会赏我一枚奖章\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd pin a medal on me if I did…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.75,1:13:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.93,1:14:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,考文垂难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Coventry conundrum.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.69,1:14:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我的解决方法如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of my solution?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.87,1:14:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人航班\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flight of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.91,1:14:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机在半空中爆炸 恐怖分子达到了目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plane blows up midair, mission accomplished for the terrorists,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.95,1:14:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤亡数上百 但没人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}hundreds of casualties, but nobody dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.70,1:14:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很干净吧 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neat, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.14,1:14:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你很早就接触到事情的真相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been stumbling around the fringes of this one for ages.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.56,1:14:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说你觉得太无聊 而忽略了其中的规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or were you too bored to notice the pattern?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.80,1:14:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷去世时他们不让我们去看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wouldn't let us see Granddad when he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.35,1:14:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是我姑姑 我分辨得出人的骨灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not my real aunt, I know human ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.22,1:14:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前和德国人有过类似的合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran a similar project with the Germans a while back,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.79,1:14:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其中一位乘客没有赶上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}though I believe one of our passengers didn't make the flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.34,1:15:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你的那件案子的死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's the deceased for you…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.88,1:15:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从各种角度说 都太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}late, in every sense of the word.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.58,1:15:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机要怎么飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is the plane going to fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.89,1:15:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 无人驾驶 老把戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course, unmanned aircraft, hardly new.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.23,1:15:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.66,1:15:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will never fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.28,1:15:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个计划都取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This entire project is cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.55,1:15:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖组织得知了我们知道炸弹的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The terrorist cells have been informed that we know about the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.92,1:15:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在骗不了他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't fool them now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.99,1:15:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们输得一败涂地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.95,1:15:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一封邮件中的一小段话\N{\fnArial\fs30}One fragment of one email,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.66,1:15:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,成年累月的计划 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and months and years of planning, finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.09,1:15:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你国防部的手下 - 老鼠屎坏了一锅粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your MOD man. - That's all it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.40,1:15:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个孤独幼稚的男人 总想显摆自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}One lonely, naive man, desperate to show off,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.30,1:15:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个聪明到让他自以为很特别的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a woman clever enough to make him feel special.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.54,1:15:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们国防部选人时应该更谨慎点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should screen your defence people more carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.59,1:15:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在说那个国防部的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about the MOD man,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.55,1:15:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 我说的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, I'm talking about you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.71,1:15:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,身陷困境的少女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damsel in distress.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.19,1:16:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头来 你的观察力还这么敏锐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, are you really so obvious?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.90,1:16:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这不是明摆着的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this was textbook.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.41,1:16:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱的承诺 失去的痛苦 挽回的快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The promise of love, the pain of loss, the joy of redemption.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.21,1:16:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再给他个谜题 看他尽情发挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then give him a puzzle and watch him dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.94,1:16:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别胡说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be absurd!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.29,1:16:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absurd?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.73,1:16:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮她破解那封邮件你用了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How quickly did you decipher that email for her?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.87,1:16:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it the full minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.61,1:16:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你就这么想表现一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or were you really eager to impress?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.88,1:16:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到5秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was less than five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.67,1:16:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我让你着了她的道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drove you into her path.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.02,1:16:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.47,1:16:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 看来我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, I think we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.53,1:16:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得 还有很多事我不太清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I, there are a number of aspects I'm still not clear on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.13,1:16:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你 小阿福 没你的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you, Junior, you're done now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.77,1:16:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多 非常多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more, loads more.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.93,1:16:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手机里存着秘密 照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this phone I've got secrets, pictures.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.22,1:16:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有能让你一败涂地的丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and scandals that could topple your whole world.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.68,1:16:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法想象我能造成多大的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how much havoc I can cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.70,1:16:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不知道如何阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and exactly one way to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.96,1:17:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想告诉你的上司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want to tell your masters.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.71,1:17:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最大的安全漏洞就是你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your biggest security leak is your own little brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.98,1:17:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以找人破解你的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have people who can get into this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.14,1:17:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tested that theory for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.57,1:17:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了夏洛克·福尔摩斯六个月时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let Sherlock Holmes try it for six months.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.85,1:17:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, dear, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.57,1:17:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他你扫描我手机时发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you found when you x-rayed my camera phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.02,1:17:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机壳下面装了四个零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are four additional units wired inside the casing,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.68,1:17:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是含酸物质或微型炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect containing acid or a small amount of explosive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.96,1:17:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人试图打开手机壳 硬盘就会销毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any attempt to open the casing will burn the hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.54,1:17:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explosive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.41,1:17:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,更符合我性格\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.30,1:17:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些数据是可恢复的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some data is always recoverable.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.14,1:17:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.63,1:17:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,解锁需要密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a passcode to open this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.04,1:17:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾地告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deeply regret to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.27,1:17:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把密码逼问出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have people who can extract it from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.43,1:17:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 - 有两组密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock? - There will be two passcodes…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.46,1:17:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个可以解锁 一个会烧掉驱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}one to open the phone, one to burn the drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.50,1:17:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算威胁她 也不知道她给的是哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even under duress, you can't know which one she's giving you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.43,1:17:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而机会只有一次 - 他真是厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and there would be no point in second attempt. - He's good, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.22,1:17:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真该好好调教他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have him on a leash.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.21,1:18:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I might.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.57,1:18:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就毁了它 谁也别想得到里面的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We destroy this, then. No-one has the information.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.90,1:18:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.54,1:18:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你要毁掉的这信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless there are lives of British citizens.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.37,1:18:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能关系着英国人民的生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}depending on the information you burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.46,1:18:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是嘛 - 告诉你就是公平游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are there? - Telling you would be playing fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.65,1:18:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再玩游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not playing any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.56,1:18:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}A list of my requests,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.94,1:18:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有承诺兑现后对我的保护措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some ideas about my protection once they're granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.72,1:18:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说这花不了国家多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say it wouldn't blow much of a hole in the wealth of a nation,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.37,1:18:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是谎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then I'd be lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.03,1:18:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能需要时间考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine you'd like to sleep on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.44,1:18:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.94,1:18:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.81,1:18:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去着手办这件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off you pop and talk to people.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.47,1:18:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你考虑得十分周道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been very…thorough.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.59,1:18:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人能有你一半能耐就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish our lot were half as good as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.23,1:18:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是全靠我自己 有人帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take all the credit, I had a bit of help.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.08,1:19:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,金·莫里亚蒂向你们问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim Moriarty sends his love.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.62,1:19:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 他就没消停过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he's been in touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.20,1:19:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫不及待想让我盯上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems desperate for my attention,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.40,1:19:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就满足他\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I'm sure can be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.05,1:19:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息一直在我手上 但我不知道怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had all this stuff and never knew what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.21,1:19:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢这个犯罪顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God for the consultant criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.70,1:19:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了我很多建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave me a lot of advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.31,1:19:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,教我如何跟你们打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how to play the Holmes boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.92,1:19:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他叫你们什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what he calls you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.67,1:19:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ice Man…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.35,1:19:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,和处子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Virgin.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.96,1:19:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不要任何回报 我想他只是喜欢捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't even ask for anything, I think he just likes to cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.60,1:19:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢这种男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}now that's my kind of man.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.41,1:19:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以成全了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here you are,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.51,1:19:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让全国为之屈服的施虐女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dominatrix who brought a nation to its knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.40,1:19:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicely played.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.06,1:19:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.75,1:19:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.33,1:19:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.20,1:19:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点成功 不过没戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very, very close, but no.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.18,1:19:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太入迷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.02,1:19:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的游戏玩过了 你过于沉迷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game was too elaborate, you were enjoying yourself too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.35,1:19:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可没有「过头」这一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.09,1:20:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以享受追捕的兴奋感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, enjoying the thrill of the chase is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.34,1:20:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望用这游戏作为消遣 我完全赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Craving the distraction of the game, I sympathise entirely,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.09,1:20:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你却感情用事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but sentiment?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.49,1:20:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,感情用事是失败者的生理缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sentiment is a chemical defect found in the losing side.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.62,1:20:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,感情用事 你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sentiment? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.24,1:20:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.21,1:20:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.41,1:20:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个小可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the poor man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.20,1:20:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真觉得我对你有兴趣吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't actually think I was interested in you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.69,1:20:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.84,1:20:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是伟大的夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're the great Sherlock Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.84,1:20:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴着滑稽帽子的大侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}the clever detective in the funny hat?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.54,1:20:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.12,1:20:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我摸到了你的脉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I took your pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.70,1:20:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏加快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevated.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.66,1:20:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞳孔放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pupils dilated.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.87,1:20:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜约翰·华生觉得我不解风情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine John Watson thinks love's a mystery to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.98,1:21:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但两人碰出火花非常简单 而且十分致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the chemistry is incredibly simple and very destructive.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.76,1:21:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们初次见面时你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we first met, you told me that…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.93,1:21:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装是一幅自画像 一点没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}disguise is always a self-portrait, how true of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.26,1:21:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险柜的密码是你的三围\N{\fnArial\fs30}The combination to your safe, your measurements.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.13,1:21:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个 这个就私人多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this, this is far more intimate,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.01,1:21:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的心 而你不应该随心而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is your heart and you should never let it rule your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.77,1:21:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你随便选组数字做密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have chosen any random number.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.09,1:21:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天你就能顺利从这里离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and walked out of here today with everything you work for.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.79,1:21:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你就是忍不住 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you just couldn't resist it, could you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.82,1:21:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直认为爱是个危险的不利因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always assumed that love is a dangerous disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.08,1:21:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你最终又证明了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for the final proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.35,1:21:53.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手机已锁 密码： SHER）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.89,1:21:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所说的一切都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I said, it's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.76,1:21:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在玩游戏而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just playing the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.74,1:21:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.66,1:21:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is just losing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.44,1:21:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.75,1:21:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望里面的内容足以弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}hope the contents make up for.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.02,1:21:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我给你造成的任何麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}any inconvenience I may have caused you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.83,1:21:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certain they will.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.14,1:22:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是好心 就把她关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're feeling kind, lock her up,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.24,1:22:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走的话 没了手机她肯定活不长\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise let her go and I doubt she'll survive long without her pretection.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.04,1:22:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是要我求你吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you expecting me to beg? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.14,1:22:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.76,1:22:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.93,1:22:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定活不过半年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't even last six months.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.70,1:22:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭的事情抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.12,1:22:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不抽烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't smoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.59,1:22:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也从不来咖啡馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also don't frequent cafes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.00,1:23:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是艾琳·阿德勒的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}This the file on Irene Adler?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.81,1:23:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,永久封档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closed forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.78,1:23:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要去通知我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am about to go and inform my brother…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.10,1:23:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你愿意的话 由你去说\N{\fnArial\fs30}or, if you prefer, you are…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.15,1:23:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在美国申请到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she somehow got herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.42,1:23:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,证人保护计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a witness protection scheme in America.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.95,1:23:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,新名字 新身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}New name, new identity.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.36,1:23:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会健康地活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will survive and thrive…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.49,1:23:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他永远见不到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he will never see her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.00,1:23:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会在意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he care?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.57,1:23:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最后他瞧不起她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He despised her at the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.79,1:23:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,提起她都不说名字 只是说「那个女人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't even mention her by name, just "The Woman".
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.61,1:23:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是厌恶还是赞扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that loathing or a salute?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.75,1:23:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,独一无二 唯一让他在意的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of a kind, the one woman who matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.14,1:23:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.06,1:23:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他不会有这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't feel things that way, I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.18,1:23:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟的大脑堪比科学家或哲学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother has the brain of a scientist or a philosopher,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.86,1:23:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他选择当名侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet he elects to be a detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.12,1:23:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于他的内心 我们能推测多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What might we deduce about his heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.39,1:23:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.15,1:23:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.15,1:23:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他最初的愿望是当一名海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, initially, he wanted to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.28,1:24:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该可以接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be OK with this…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.24,1:24:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,证人保护计划 再也不能见面 他不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}witness protection, never seeing her again, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.13,1:24:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.49,1:24:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我决定这样告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I decided to tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.88,1:24:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那事实是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of what?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.57,1:24:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.22,1:24:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个月前 她被卡拉奇的一个恐怖组织俘获\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was captured by a terrorist cell in Karachi two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.49,1:24:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,被砍头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and beheaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.15,1:24:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定是她本人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was definitely her?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.32,1:24:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她耍过一次诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.84,1:24:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我保证万无一失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thorough this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.87,1:24:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,想骗我得夏洛克·福尔摩斯亲自出马\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would take Sherlock Holmes to fool me,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.11,1:24:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我觉得他并不在场 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't think he was on hand, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.27,1:24:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.47,1:24:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么对夏洛克说\N{\fnArial\fs30}what shall we tell Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.39,1:25:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你有消息要告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly you've got news.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.58,1:25:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是利兹三连环杀人案的话 凶手是园丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's about the Leeds triple murder, it was the gardener.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.13,1:25:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没人注意到耳环吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody notice the earring?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.92,1:25:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是关于艾琳·阿德勒的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er no, it's, um…it's about Irene Adler.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.98,1:25:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.33,1:25:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了吗 她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened? Has she come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.69,1:25:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.64,1:25:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在楼下遇到麦考夫了 他要去接个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just bumped into Mycroft downstairs, he had to take a call.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.21,1:25:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她回伦敦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she back in London?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.37,1:25:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.05,1:25:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's, er…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.51,1:25:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在美国 - 美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's in America. - America?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.60,1:25:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她申请到了证人保护计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got herself on a witness protection scheme, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.77,1:25:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道她怎么办到 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know how she swung it, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.80,1:25:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.04,1:25:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 懂什么 - 你不能再见她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know what? - You won't be able to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.49,1:25:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我为什么想再见她 - 我也没这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would I want to see her again? - Didn't say you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.29,1:25:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是她的档案吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that her file? - Yes,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.67,1:25:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要拿去还给麦考夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to take it back to Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.19,1:25:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要… - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to… - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.82,1:26:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, actually…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.51,1:26:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她的手机给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will have the camera-phone though.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.07,1:26:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面没东西了 都被删掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing on it anymore, it's been stripped…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.99,1:26:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but I…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.41,1:26:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll still have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.48,1:26:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把它还给麦考夫 你不能留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to give this back to Mycroft, you can't keep it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.58,1:26:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 我得把它还给麦考夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, I have to give this to Mycroft,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.40,1:26:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是政府财产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the government's now…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.16,1:26:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.75,1:26:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.84,1:26:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得把东西还回去了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I'd better take this back. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.85,1:26:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后 她有再给你发过短信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she ever text you again, after all that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.64,1:26:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月前有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once, a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.47,1:26:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.56,1:27:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Goodbye, Mr Holmes."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.53,1:27:23.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我不饿 一起吃晚饭吧）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.33,1:27:23.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（在宾馆好无聊 你过来吧 一起吃晚饭）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.93,1:27:24.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（约翰的博客好好笑 我看他比我更喜欢你 一起吃晚饭吧）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.33,1:27:24.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（推理出我在哪 过来找我）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.73,1:27:25.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（今天我在街上看见你了 你没看见我）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.13,1:27:25.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你知道那帽子很适合你吧）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.43,1:27:25.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我的天呀 一起吃晚饭吧）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.73,1:27:26.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我喜欢你那顶滑稽的帽子）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.03,1:27:26.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我在埃及 和个白痴说话 正要上飞机 一起吃晚饭吧）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.33,1:27:26.63,Title,0,0,0,0,,（你在《绳之于法》里真性感）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.63,1:27:27.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（就算是你也得吃饭 一起吃晚饭吧）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.03,1:27:27.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（快看BBC1台 太搞笑了）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.53,1:27:27.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我想给你寄个圣诞礼物）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.93,1:27:28.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（看壁炉台）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.43,1:27:29.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我没死 一起吃晚饭吧）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.73,1:27:33.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（再见 福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.23,1:27:41.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（再见 福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.32,1:27:54.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（再见 福尔摩斯先生）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.96,1:27:55.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发送）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.25,1:28:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I say run…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.89,1:28:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}run!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.38,1:28:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.68,1:28:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman.
